<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Before starting a phone or tablet transfer, make a private inventory of what matters and confirm that you can still access the accounts needed to continue. Check the current backup and synchronisation state without assuming that everything is included. Make the source stable, powered and available. If it is broken, locked or compromised, stop the routine process and seek the relevant specialist or provider.</p>
